```

## Validation

### Data annotations

Define validation rules on the model:

```csharp
public class EmployeeModel
{
    [Required, StringLength(100)]
    public string? Name { get; set; }

    [Required, EmailAddress]
    public string? Email { get; set; }

    [Range(18, 99)]
    public int Age { get; set; }

